(50 mm ring probe qualification)
(Start above the left inside edge of the ring, roughly centered in Y, at safe Z)
(This cycle does not write a work offset. It is for qualifying the probe only.)

G21 G17 G40 G49 G54 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G94

#<probe_tool_number> = #3014
#<max_z_distance> = #3020
#<max_xy_distance> = #3018
#<xy_clearance> = #3019
#<z_clearance> = #3021
#<step_off_width> = #3023
#<extra_probe_depth> = #3022
